BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (Calendar mistakes kill visibility. Shona warns that a calendar peppered with random weekend bookings will) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (not show up in search results, which is why the play is a duplicate listing with an open calendar) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm ([pWVHjrvUQkc @ 00:22:25]. Ruben Kanya opens the STR window no more than 30 days out and refuses) Tj ET
