BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (lead timing is unpredictable, prescribes a 2-3 month cash cushion, and reports Atlanta STR oversupply with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (PriceLabs dragging rates down plus disappointing World Cup bookings [-OpbvAckfkQ @ 00:22:22]. Jesse) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (Vasquez sees maturing markets such as Philly, LA and Boston shaving as much as $500 off what hosts got) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (the year before [a7yG_MgRly4 @ 00:03:48]. Ruben Kanya names the biggest risk plainly: no contract is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (promised, because this is a relationship business. Adrian's cold start shows the same gap: rehab, furnish,) Tj ET
