BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 285.77 Tm (The most expensive firsthand failure on the payer's side is the hotel stay that never ends. Kela Trishaan is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 270.55 Tm (working a file where a family has sat in a hotel for roughly three months, which Trishaan calls a no-no) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 255.32 Tm (because it risks exhausting the ALE limit, and three to five dogs made comparable housing hard to find) Tj ET
