BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 589.77 Tm (The first trap is the wrong guest. Dr Chau Ong's vacation-rental partiers trashed the place, which he calls a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 574.55 Tm (nightmare and the reason he now targets corporate travelers, medical professionals and insurance clients) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 559.32 Tm ([JWjjZOTJhUs @ 00:01:38]. In a separate breakdown he says he never had one eviction from corporate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 544.10 Tm (guests in six years but did evict a vacationer, while elsewhere he cites ten years and seven to eight years) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 528.87 Tm (with zero evictions, so the record is strong but the tenure figure moves [v4LiJvYw8rc @ 00:02:34]. Sheree) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 513.65 Tm (Hill shows that a corporate label does not screen anyone by itself: she verifies the employer, runs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 498.42 Tm (background checks for evictions and fraud, notes that Atlanta is number one in the fraud, and caught a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 483.20 Tm (scammer using different names with five eviction cases on file [nZd4KYLOZDw @ 00:19:04]. Jesse Vasquez) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 467.97 Tm (adds the squatter angle. Companies book through Airbnb for the million-dollar coverage, but if a guest) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 452.75 Tm (squats, Airbnb is not going to go there to kick them out, so he still pushes for a lease signed by the company) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 437.52 Tm (or occupant to get local legal protection [ypZmx1qTnpY @ 00:00:13]. Payment rails matter too: he screens) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 422.30 Tm (and collects through Turbo Tenant and says flatly not to use Zelle.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 407.07 Tm (Vacancy is where arbitrage capital dies. Jorge Garcia's lease-first unit sat empty while he waited for demand) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 391.85 Tm (he had not yet built, the experience behind his backwards model [Ewazlh6zOLM @ 00:01:05]. Angela Healy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 376.62 Tm (warns that competitors who sublet apartments collapse in downturns, which is exactly why Avenue West) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 361.40 Tm (uses management agreements where owner and operator share vacancy rather than one side carrying fixed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 346.17 Tm (rent [f2vS4cnBnoI @ 00:20:48]. Tim Touchette lived the stress test. During COVID a friend's ten-unit nightly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 330.95 Tm (building in Dupont Circle hit 100% vacancy, while his own corporate book was down about 7 and 1/2%) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 315.72 Tm ([ZJwE-gL3Y20 @ 00:45:01]. The slower bleed is contract length. Companies now cap commitments at three) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 300.50 Tm (months, and that shift cost him condo buildings that imposed six-month minimums, so any building rule) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 285.27 Tm (longer than your client's commitment window is dead inventory [ZJwE-gL3Y20 @ 00:50:10]. The economics) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 270.05 Tm (check is simple: if your structure forces you to pay rent on a dark unit, your downside is the entire lease, not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 254.82 Tm (a soft month, and the only two hedges these operators report are shared-vacancy owner agreements and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 239.60 Tm (demand secured before the keys.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 224.37 Tm (The last set of traps is operational speed and cash recovery. Sheree Hill says a broken oven cannot wait) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 209.15 Tm (three to four days for a corporate guest, home warranties don't move fast, and the fix is a repair retainer the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 193.92 Tm (owner keeps on file [nZd4KYLOZDw @ 00:24:05]. The Roadmap Lodging breakdown names the product) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 178.70 Tm (misses that cost corporate bookings: spotty internet is a work stoppage for an engineer or consultant, accent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 163.47 Tm (walls and Instagrammable decor might even hurt you, and a kitchen table instead of a desk with an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 148.25 Tm (ergonomic chair fails a 90-day stay that HR managers will notice [iQn0PMSPJ5Q @ 00:05:39]. On capital,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 133.02 Tm (Dr Chau Ong's startup math runs $2,500 rent, a $2,500 deposit and $7,000 of furniture for $12,000 out of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 117.80 Tm (pocket, recouped in six months at $2,000 a month, with furnishing capped at $7,000 to $9,000) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 102.57 Tm ([yo5DDACarw0 @ 00:25:58]. Jesse Vasquez funds through a 0% or 3 to 5% first-year credit card or an SBA) Tj ET
