BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (six, "don't say Airbnb, say corporate housing company," because the platform name triggers fear of parties) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (and damage [Q3hSpjquUTE @ 00:06:28]. Licata backs the company name with real demand channels:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (insurance groups, hospitals, Furnishfinder and Booking.com. Jorge Contreras reports the same reflex from) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (the other side of the phone: open with "I'd love to Airbnb your house" and the landlord hears "party" and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (hangs up, so the house rules go up front instead, with no parties, quiet hours 9pm to 9am, and security) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (cameras [_M0OdXelhoU @ 00:02:49]. 360 BNB Solutions scripts the replacement line word for word: "Mr) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (landlord we are a corporate leasing company," serving travel nurses, doctors, chiropractors, professionals) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (and hospital patients, with no smokers, no pets and generally no little kids [prqw1liLbCM @ 00:02:03]. Rafa) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (Loza frames the logic as channel versus business: Airbnb is one channel alongside VRBO, Booking.com,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (Furnishfinder and Expedia, and the operator is the business, "You run a restaurant that happens to be listed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (on Yelp" [894g1JF-IuM @ 00:12:37].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (Once the vocabulary is fixed, the operators agree the pitch lives or dies on two landlord fears. 360 BNB) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (Solutions boils it down bluntly: "most landlords care about two things keeping my property in great condition) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (and are you going to make the payments on time," and answers both with professional cleaning one to two) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (times a week, all maintenance handled, a "for sale" condition a long-term tenant never delivers, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (payment by direct deposit with no eviction risk [prqw1liLbCM @ 00:04:16]. Jorge Contreras attacks the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (payment fear mechanically: fixed advertised rent that never fluctuates, autopay set "two days early," and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (100% written responsibility for guest-caused damage while the owner keeps age-related wear like a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (10-year-old AC [d8qhoiAWdLs @ 00:01:43]. Aurelio Licata reframes the whole conversation in lesson) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (eleven: "you're not offering rent, you're offering relief," meaning consistent rent, no property manager to hire,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (multi-year leases and monthly professional cleaning set against the landlord's vacancy and turnover pain) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm ([Q3hSpjquUTE @ 00:10:14]. Lara Stewart, a 28-year RN running three Houston units, strips it even simpler:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm ("you're asking to pay them rent every month is what you're asking to do" [mOvanxNbxWw @ 00:11:19].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (Licata's line covers the nerves: "landlords aren't grading your resume.") Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (The baseline prerequisites are just as consistent. Short Term Sage host John insists on signing as a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (business, because "if you sign it personally you are now the tenant that they expect," while warning that big) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.15 Tm (REITs may still demand "company name slash your name" and a personal guarantee; a Dun & Bradstreet) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.92 Tm (DUNS number builds the business credit separate from Experian, Equifax and TransUnion [wt5AlXFsjDQ @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 289.70 Tm (00:09:54]. Colin Wright's setup list is entity, tax ID, business bank account, professional email and website,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 274.47 Tm (then verification of city, building, HOA and landlord rules plus permits, with permission in writing, because "I) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 259.25 Tm (would never try to sneak Airbnb past a landlord" [iwB0c3u7Gpo @ 00:06:45]. Lease length is the next) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 244.02 Tm (shared rule: Jorge Contreras prefers two- to three-year terms to lock in rent since payback runs six to nine) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 228.80 Tm (months, and "you don't want to have to restart every 12 months with a new listing" [_M0OdXelhoU @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 213.57 Tm (00:06:23]. Finally, LoCasa sets the scaling prerequisite: "Your first unit should be your laboratory," testing) Tj ET
