BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 445.77 Tm (Jesse Vasquez learned the lease lesson the expensive way: starting in 2015 with generic leases that could) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 430.55 Tm (not be enforced, then getting burned in 2017 by a peer-to-peer payment chargeback, which is why Venmo,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 415.32 Tm (Zelle, and Cash App are now off the table and keys never move before first month's rent [VtuboLMzJj0 @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 400.10 Tm (00:04:07]. The sharper loss came from skipped inspections, when an eight-month insurance stay damaged) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 384.87 Tm (a treehouse property; the fix is a monthly walk-through between the 25th and 30th with 48-hour notice,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 369.65 Tm (because you want to send somebody every single month [VtuboLMzJj0 @ 00:16:04]. Midterm Rental) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 354.42 Tm (Consulting rejects the Furnished Finder damage waiver because its terms make claims too hard, assumes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 339.20 Tm (deposit mishandling drives about 90% of non-eviction landlord court cases, and parks every deposit in a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 323.97 Tm (dedicated per-property savings account with every deduction documented [PLf1d4djjZw @ 00:01:20]. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 308.75 Tm (Airbnb Hosting hosts add the calendar trap: never block dates until the lease is signed, because tire kickers) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 293.52 Tm (are everywhere and anyone selling an easy button is lying, and with average stays around three months,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 278.30 Tm (expect three to four lease-ups a year [264jEA_cXOw @ 00:19:55]. Contracts can end early or extend, so the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 263.07 Tm (calendar is never truly locked in, even after signing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 247.85 Tm (Bailey Kramer, who ran 30 short-term rentals, draws the line operators blur: an MTR is a temporary house,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 232.62 Tm (not an epic weekend experience, and people skimp on the bed, while blackout curtains, a white noise) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 217.40 Tm (machine for night-shift nurses, and a real desk are treated as non-negotiable [De_DgYIghMo @ 00:07:22].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 202.17 Tm (Kramer also warns against ordering furniture before closing because delays happen, insists on a dumpster) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 186.95 Tm (after once hauling flattened boxes in a Tesla, and flags that a 0% Amex Business Blue Plus card turns crazy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 171.72 Tm (expensive if the balance is not cleared, so cash stays on hand [De_DgYIghMo @ 00:09:12]. The Furnished) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 156.50 Tm (Rental Strategist hits the same nerve from the decor side, warning that too much Airbnb aesthetics can) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 141.27 Tm (backfire in the MTR world and that the unit should feel like a furnished apartment, not a staged magazine) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 126.05 Tm (home [xbiJ4HzellI @ 00:04:17]. Jesse Vasquez supplies the replacement-cost trap: cheap gear gets bought) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 110.82 Tm (three times, IKEA beds and Rachael Ray cookware are out, and a Roomba loses to an old-school Hoover,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 95.60 Tm (summed up as simple scales, fancy fails [VtuboLMzJj0 @ 00:35:05]. Clint Coons's guest adds a revenue) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 80.37 Tm (trap: launching non-pet-friendly left money on the table until flipping the switch raised revenue 30%.) Tj ET
